-- Physio-App — Migration 0034: import the Everkinetic exercise base
--
-- Imports all 302 exercises from bryllim/workout-guide (CC BY-SA 4.0,
-- artist Bryl Lim — see legal/mentions-legales.md), the same source already
-- used for the 49 hand-matched illustrations in lib/exercise/illustrationMap.ts.
-- Every exercise inserted here has exactly one matching illustration set
-- already vendored under public/exercise-illustrations/<slug>/frame-{1,2,3}.svg
-- (the slug being the kebab-case form of the English name below — see
-- illustrationMap.ts's "Everkinetic base import" section for the exact
-- name -> slug pairs).
--
-- Names stay in English (Everkinetic's own names) — deliberate choice, see
-- project discussion. instructions text and body-part tags are French,
-- matching the rest of the UI.
--
-- Of the 387 pre-existing French clinical exercises, 244 have no
-- illustration match (checked against illustrationMap.ts's 143 matched
-- name-keys, spanning 49 distinct illustrations) and are dropped here. The
-- 143 that already have a match are left untouched, even though this means
-- some duplication with the new English entries for the same movement
-- (e.g. both "Renforcement excentrique du mollet, genou tendu" and the new
-- "Calf Raise" point at the same calf-raise illustration) — deliberate,
-- to be cleaned up later. Existing conditions/workouts/workout_exercises
-- rows referencing a dropped exercise are left as-is (dangling reference),
-- also deliberate — see project discussion, not reassigned here.
--
-- Body-part tags use the existing fixed vocabulary from 0032_exercise_body_parts.sql.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. Insert the 302 Everkinetic exercises
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 2. Tag each with its body part(s)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 3. Drop the 324 pre-existing clinical exercises with no illustration
--    match (exact ids read from the live DB, cross-referenced against
--    illustrationMap.ts's 143 matched name-keys). Recomputed 2026-08-29
--    against the restored 500-row baseline (exercises_backup_20260828) —
--    the original draft of this list was computed against a database
--    state corrupted by an unauthorized dedup an earlier agent run
--    executed directly against Supabase against explicit instructions;
--    that dedup has since been reverted from backup, and this list is
--    fresh against the correct baseline.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

